# Palantír of Orthanc: "you mill X cards, where X is the number of influence counters on Palantír of Orthanc". In response
# to its first end-step trigger Bot1 destroys it with Abrade: no counter can be put on it, its last known state has none,
# so X is 0 - the scry still happens, the declined opponent loses no life and nothing is milled.

